{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144440/extras/f8415f8ec1cd73e816b808ef5ca2c202.poster.avif?t=1760999887\" width=443 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144440/extras/f8415f8ec1cd73e816b808ef5ca2c202.webm?t=1760999887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reaper Rules: The Beginning of the Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaper Rules</strong> is a short and straightforward game that blends different gameplay styles to tell a story full of surprises. Face a variety of levels \u2014 from 2D platforming to top-down shooting \u2014 while exploring an intriguing world filled with memorable characters and hidden details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a compact adventure designed to be played in a single sitting, focusing on pacing, variety, and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Short story with a touch of mystery<br>\u25a0 Varied gameplay: platforming, top-down shooting, challenges, and high difficulty<br>\u25a0 Pixel art visuals and charismatic characters<br>\u25a0 An experience made with passion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey leaves a few questions unanswered \u2014 it\u2019s up to you to interpret, theorize, and imagine what lies beyond this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy short games with personality and creative gameplay, <strong>Reaper Rules</strong> is for you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Respect for the elders!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3144440/b931735eb6d571750d0a14ad66f8162f22a083c4.jpg"},{"name":"You should be asha